libcifpp
------------------------------------------
Library containing code to manipulate mmCIF and PDB files

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcifpp-devel-10.0.4-1bl2
  libcifpp10-10.0.4-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libpcre2_8_0-10.49-1
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  libsqlite3_0-3.49.1-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libCatch2-devel-3.16.1-1bl2
  libpcre2-devel-10.49-1
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/PDB-REDO/libcifpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/PDB-REDO/libcifpp/archive/refs/tags/v10.0.4.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcifpp-10.0.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcifpp-10.0.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcifpp-10.0.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcifpp-10.0.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcifpp10-10.0.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcifpp-devel-10.0.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

